{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/10/5698847/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに今日から乃木坂46時間TVです\n始まっちゃいます、46時間。\nちゃんと睡眠と休憩はとってくださいね...\n倒れちゃダメですよ(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日寝ていたら寝言が凄かったらしく\n恥ずかしかったです\nいったい何を喋っていたんだろう...\n寝言って人に聞かれるの怖いですよね\nマーマさんによると私の場合、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ん〜あ〜」「......んふあ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしいです、こわいこわい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/10/5698847/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/10/5698847/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんには氷対応です。\nだけど氷だってときには溶けます\nまなったんの可愛さに溶ける時もあります\nそれが氷対応です〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ブログを書いていて\n思い出してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛エルボー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!6見てくれた方は\nご存知かと思います(^ ^)\n能條さんごめんなさい...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっしー（こじこじ）さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・人生で一番大きな声を出した瞬間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→初めて入ったお化け屋敷ですね\n建物が崩れるんじゃないかな、\nむしろお化けの皆さんが怖がるんじゃないか\nレベルで叫びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅうさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・握手会の時ってみり愛ちゃんのこと\nなんて呼べばいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→雪見大福以外ならなんでも(^ ^)(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷりしらさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・てのひらをーたいようにー\nすかしてみーれーばーこれ曲名なんだっけ？\nってかなんで最初これ歌うの？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→手のひらを太陽にです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由聞かれてしまうと\n答えが見つからない...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野とカラオケ行ったときになぜか\n一曲目に歌いたくなりましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まこぺんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・勝手なルールさ〜が聞きたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→一緒に歌おう＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニラ派さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・期間限定と数量限定という\n誘惑に勝つ秘訣はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私はもともとそういうのに\n目を引くタイプではないのですが...\nその誘惑むしろ大事だと思いますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年前までは誘惑に負けぱなしだったけど、\n以外と試してみると\n「そうでもないかな？」\nなんて結果になりますよ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今ではかわらず好きだった物にしか目にいきません(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかっぴさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近のマイブームは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→カメラ、1人散歩、音楽をずっと聴いてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりあんさー◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなおでんの具は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計結果は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 大根"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 たまご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 はんぺん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位 巾着餅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5位 ちくわぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡県ではカツオ粉と青のりを\n混ぜたはんぺんがあると初めて知りました\n機会があれば食べてみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私は昆布とちくわぶが大好きです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも話せる友達って\n何人いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにてお待ちしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜後のコメントひとつ、ひとつ、\n大切に読ませて頂きました\n感謝しかありません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ未熟者ですがよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/10/5698847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}